menu "HubBLE BLE central"
    config HUBBLE_BLE_CONN_ITVL_UNITS
        int "Requested connection interval (1.25 ms units)"
        default 6
        range 6 80
        help
            6 = 7.5 ms, the target of CLAUDE.md §1.1 (added latency <= 15 ms). The peripheral may refuse; the
            negotiated value is exposed per device.

    config HUBBLE_BLE_CONN_LATENCY
        int "Requested peripheral latency (connection events) while the host is active"
        default 0
        range 0 30

    config HUBBLE_BLE_SUPERVISION_TIMEOUT_10MS
        int "Supervision timeout (10 ms units)"
        default 200
        range 100 3200
        help
            200 = 2 s (CLAUDE.md §3.3).
endmenu
